{
  "id": "6a83021f0e620487a9666f4a",
  "title": "唯物論",
  "created": 1786970682,
  "updated": 1786971754,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a83021f0e620487a9666f4a",
      "text": "唯物論",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970682,
      "updated": 1786970682
    },
    {
      "id": "6a83023c000000000045830d",
      "text": "[https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%94%AF%E7%89%A9%E8%AB%96 唯物論 - Wikipedia]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970685,
      "updated": 1786970686
    },
    {
      "id": "6a83023e000000000045830e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970686,
      "updated": 1786970686
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830239000000000045830b",
      "text": "[観念]や[精神]、[心]などの[根底]的なものは[物質]であると考え、それを重視する考え方",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970682,
      "updated": 1786970846
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830239000000000045830c",
      "text": " [観念]の[根底]的なものは[物質]である。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970682,
      "updated": 1786970854
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830248000000000045830f",
      "text": " [精神]の[根底]的なものは[物質]である。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970696,
      "updated": 1786970855
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8302500000000000458310",
      "text": " [心]の[根底]的なものは[物質]である。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970704,
      "updated": 1786970856
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830284000000000045831c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786970756,
      "updated": 1786971742
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8304c0000000000045832a",
      "text": "[唯物論]の対義語",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971329,
      "updated": 1786971533
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8304e4000000000045832e",
      "text": "\t[唯心論]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971364,
      "updated": 1786971517
    },
    {
      "id": "6a83057b0000000000458338",
      "text": "\t[理想論]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971516,
      "updated": 1786971519
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305870000000000458340",
      "text": " [観念論]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971527,
      "updated": 1786971527
    },
    {
      "id": "6a83050c0000000000458330",
      "text": "\t[スピリチュアリズム]（[spiritualism]）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971404,
      "updated": 1786971514
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830500000000000045832f",
      "text": "\t[メンタリズム]（[mentalism]）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971392,
      "updated": 1786971513
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305770000000000458335",
      "text": "\t[アイデアリズム]（[idealism]）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971511,
      "updated": 1786971513
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305830000000000458339",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971523,
      "updated": 1786971525
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305890000000000458341",
      "text": "[唯物論]の類語",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971530,
      "updated": 1786971717
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305bb0000000000458343",
      "text": "\t[物質主義]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971580,
      "updated": 1786971584
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305f50000000000458349",
      "text": "\t[実利主義]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971637,
      "updated": 1786971637
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305b60000000000458342",
      "text": " [マテリアリズム]（[materialism]）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971574,
      "updated": 1786971624
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830621000000000045834a",
      "text": " [機械論]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971681,
      "updated": 1786971685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8305ce0000000000458345",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971599,
      "updated": 1786971641
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830661000000000045834b",
      "text": "雑談",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971745,
      "updated": 1786971750
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830666000000000045834d",
      "text": " 精神的な悩みを精神に作用する物質*を摂取することで解決した経験があると[唯物論]を腹落ちして信じるようになるだろう[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971750,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830666000000000045834e",
      "text": "  精神に作用する物質*：まず、違法薬物のことではない。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830666000000000045834f",
      "text": "  \t日常的に摂取可能なもの：アルコール、ニコチン、カフェイン、糖質など",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458350",
      "text": "  \t非日常的だが処方されるもの：精神科で処方されるお薬",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458351",
      "text": "  \t通常違法だが極めて限定的に処方されるもの：モルヒネ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458352",
      "text": " \t実際に効くので",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458353",
      "text": "   > [精神]の[根底]的なものは[物質]である。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458354",
      "text": "   > [心]の[根底]的なものは[物質]である。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458355",
      "text": "   となる。",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971754
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8306660000000000458356",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971751,
      "updated": 1786971751
    },
    {
      "id": "6a830661000000000045834c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786971746,
      "updated": 1786971746
    }
  ]
}